{
  "_comment": "Harness mode: the static settings every worker run gets on top of the RC settings (no phone, so no ask). The deny list is the floor (naila packages/harness/src/capabilities.ts FLOOR_DENY) plus the docs folders /run/docs-token and /run/docs-sock (Rulings 19, 22) and the API providers' keys at /run/provider-keys (no allow reaches any of them): denied whatever a run's capability switches say. The allow list is only the core tools no switch governs (decision_status, propose_capability_change and the self_note tools) plus ask_worker and propose_plan, kept so a rollback to an older image is never less safe (P24); every other allow comes from each run's own settings, generated by the core from its switches (P22), and so do naila's own engine_info and undo_vault_change, allowed in her runs alone (the undo never in an ask, a follow-up, a scheduled run or a forward), never here.",
